        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "For example"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": ", the performance of actors and actresses is very important in your film."
        }
      ],
      "zh": "例如，在你的电影中，演员的表现是非常重要的。"
    }
  ],
  "tip": [
    {
      "id": "p1",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "for example 和 such as 的意思都是“例如”，但在用法上是有区别的。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "strong",
          "v": "for example"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " 的位置较灵活，可放在句首、句中或句尾，通常用逗号与其所列举的部分隔开，另外，其后面可以是句子，也可以是单词词组。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "strong",
          "v": "such as"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " 只能放在其所列举部分的前面，而且不用逗号隔开，后面接的是名词。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "例如："
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "For example"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": ", a bicycle driven by electricity can avoid pollution."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "例如，电动自行车可以避免污染。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "There are many sources of air pollution; exhaust fumes, "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "for example"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "空气污染源有许多种，例如废气。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p6",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "He can speak several languages "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "such as"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " English, Japanese and French."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "他会说好几种语言，比如英语、日语和法语。"
        }
      ]
    }
